    <statement><p>What are the rectangular coordinates of the point whose spherical coordinates
 are</p>
<p><m>\left( 4 , {\frac{1}{3}} \pi, {\frac{1}{2}} \pi \right)</m> ?</p>
<p><m>x =</m> <fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>y =</m><fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
<p><m>z =</m><fillin characters="40" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4\cos\mathopen{}\left(\frac{1}{3}\pi \right)\sin\mathopen{}\left(\frac{1}{2}\pi \right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
